Third party files:

  tools/vendor/asm.py, tools/vendor/iss.py
      The RV32I assembler and the reference instruction set model used by the
      differential verification flow.  They originate from the same author's
      rvai project and are covered by the same MIT license as the rest of this
      repository.  They are kept byte identical to their originals (see
      tools/vendor/README.md for the checksums); do not add headers to them.

  Everything else in this repository (RTL, testbenches, test programs, tools,
  documentation and figures) was written for this project.
